# Values

> empty = ""
> quoted = "  keep  spaces "
> escapes = "line\nbreak \"quote\" back\\slash"
> list-plain = a, b , c
> list-brackets = [1, "two, three", 4]
> list-empty = []
> unicode = héllo wörld ✓
> trailing = x =

Quote lines without an equals sign are text:

> just a quote
> = no key

    > indented = code, not an entry
